// Title: Standard User In High Privileged Group
// ID: 7ac407cc-0f48-4328-aede-de1d2e6fef41
// Status: test
// Level: medium
// Author: frack113
// Date: 2023-01-13
// Tags: attack.credential-access, attack.privilege-escalation
// Description: Detect standard users login that are part of high privileged groups such as the Administrator group
// Converted by: Sigma Universal SIEM/EDR CLI

((EventID EQ "300" AND TargetUserSid STARTSWITH "S-1-5-21-" AND (SidList CONTAINS "S-1-5-32-544" OR SidList CONTAINS "-500}" OR SidList CONTAINS "-518}" OR SidList CONTAINS "-519}")) AND NOT (((TargetUserSid ENDSWITH "-500" OR TargetUserSid ENDSWITH "-518" OR TargetUserSid ENDSWITH "-519"))))
